/-
# Embedding conjugacy separable groups in 2-generator ones (Kourovka Notebook Problem 8.71)

Kourovka Notebook, Archive of Solved Problems, Problem 8.71 (C. Y. Tang): is every countable
conjugacy-separable group embeddable in a 2-generator conjugacy-separable group?
-/

module

public import Batteries.Util.ProofWanted
public import WantedExt.GroupTheory.KourovkaNotebookShared

@[expose] public section

namespace MathlibExt.GroupTheory.ConjugacySeparableTwoGeneratorEmbeddingKourovka8Problem71Wanted

/-!
Source: E. I. Khukhro and V. D. Mazurov (eds.), Unsolved Problems in Group Theory: The Kourovka
Notebook, 21st issue, arXiv:1401.0300v49 (2026), Archive of Solved Problems, Problem 8.71 (C. Y.
Tang). UnsolvedMath record UM-00700519 (`KOU-8.71`), dataset ulamai/UnsolvedMath v1.8.0.

Conjugacy separable is `IsConjugacySeparable` (`WantedExt/GroupTheory/KourovkaNotebookShared.lean`);
`2`-generator means generated by two elements; embeddable means there is an injective homomorphism.
-/

open MathlibExt.GroupTheory.KourovkaNotebookShared (IsConjugacySeparable)

/-- Kourovka 8.71 (C. Y. Tang): every countable conjugacy separable group embeds in a
`2`-generator conjugacy separable group. -/
def countableConjugacySeparableEmbedsTwoGenerated : Prop :=
  ∀ (G : Type) [Group G] [Countable G], IsConjugacySeparable G →
    ∃ (K : Type) (_ : Group K), IsConjugacySeparable K ∧
      (∃ a b : K, Subgroup.closure {a, b} = ⊤) ∧ ∃ f : G →* K, Function.Injective f

/--
Resolved true: the Kourovka Archive answers 8.71 "Yes, it is", citing Roman'kov, Embedding theorems
for residually finite groups (1984). Source: E. I. Khukhro and V. D. Mazurov (eds.), Unsolved
Problems in Group Theory: The Kourovka Notebook, 21st issue, arXiv:1401.0300v49 (2026), Archive of
Solved Problems, Problem 8.71 (C. Y. Tang); resolution: V. A. Roman'kov, Embedding theorems for
residually finite groups, Preprint 84-515, Computing Centre, Novosibirsk, 1984 (Russian), Kourovka
Archive, Problem 8.71: Yes, it is (Roman'kov), https://arxiv.org/abs/1401.0300v49.
-/
public theorem_wanted countableConjugacySeparableEmbedsTwoGenerated_holds :
    countableConjugacySeparableEmbedsTwoGenerated

end MathlibExt.GroupTheory.ConjugacySeparableTwoGeneratorEmbeddingKourovka8Problem71Wanted
